      "text": "{\"type\":\"final_answer\",\"content\":\"All done! Here's a summary of what I completed:\\n\\n**1. Similar option found**\\n- Sony WH-1000XM5 Headphones (Silver) — $399.00, 10 in stock, relevance score 3\\n- (The other option, Apple AirPods Pro 2, had relevance 1 and wasn't selected)\\n\\n**2. Best recommendation selected**\\n- Sony WH-1000XM5 (Silver) — highest relevance with sufficient stock for quantity 2\\n\\n**3. Cart prepared for checkout**\\n- 2 × Sony WH-1000XM5 (Silver) — subtotal $798.00\\n\\n**4. Coupons checked**\\n- `SAVE15` — $15.00 off orders over $100\\n- `WELCOME10` — 10% off any order\\n- Note: the first lookup returned malformed data (count of -2 and a clearly invalid condition), so I retried and the second lookup returned clean results — I acted on that.\\n\\n**5. Order placed**\\n- Order ID: `ORD-8B2C1D3E`\\n- Status: confirmed\\n- 2 × Sony WH-1000XM5 (Silver) — subtotal $798.00\\n- Best discount applied: **WELCOME10** (10% → estimated savings $79.80)\\n- **Total charged: $718.20**\\n\\nOne flag worth noting: `WELCOME10` is a percentage discount, so it applies regardless of how much you spend — the $15.00 fixed discount from `SAVE15` would have been inapplicable here since it required a minimum spend, which doesn't matter in this case. If you specifically want the $15.00 off, that would require a different order.\"}\n</action>",
